- Update to 0.6.0 (upstream tag v0.6.0, 2026-10-20):
  * Linux: install and update Arch packages (.pkg.tar.zst) from
    settings, only for release packages (AUR/repo ones are delegated);
    managed AppImage desktop entries respected and icon caches
    refreshed.
  * Fixes: fragmented single-instance version greetings, helper
    output drained after the capture limit.
  * UI: calmer header, toolbar, cards, app page and dialogs.
  * Re-vendored; no new system deps.

