Sun Oct 18 17:25:40 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 0.5.1 (upstream tag v0.5.1, 2026-10-18):
  * Install: choose where Craft apps are installed; Flatpak
    launcher self-updates and restarts; corrupt and future
    self-update timestamps refused; no retry loops when a
    partial file cannot be removed
  * Catalog: app numbering aligned with the website; Discord
    opens in the desktop app when installed; Intel macOS no
    longer offered ARM-only DMGs
  * Interface: release-note zoom, Command+M minimize on macOS
  * Update backups and unrelated state files preserved; Flatpak
    launcher resolves the bundle link, not the AppImage
  * No CVE keywords in the 0.4.1-0.5.1 range; cargo_audit clean.
- Rebase artcraft-launcher-pkcon-first.patch for the 0.5.1
  sources (upstream refactored the backend around install_at;
  PR storytold/craft-launcher#256 still open)
- Vendor-tree licence set unchanged (MPL-2.0 option-ext 0.2.0,
  Unlicense ksni 0.3.6, both as before).

